sb (0.2.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add NVMe and IT8613 auxiliary thermal telemetry (10 s rollups) for
    tuning; it does not affect fan control yet.
  * Record daemon starts, versions and configurations in daemon_runs.
  * Leave hard-max at fan_hard_exit_temp (default 70 C) instead of
    fan_soft_max.
  * Write PWM only on change, with a periodic refresh.
  * Validate drift and hard-max-exit ordering; log PWM/state changes and
    warn on a stalled fan.

 -- Roman Contreras <roman.contreras@ciencias.unam.mx>  Sun, 08 Nov 2026 18:00:00 -0600

sb (0.1.2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Replace the unmaintained bincode 1.3.3 with bincode-next 3.1.1 using its
    legacy configuration; the IPC wire format is unchanged.
  * Raise the minimum supported Rust version to 1.90.
  * Update crossterm, rusqlite, toml, clap and tokio-util.
  * Refresh the GitHub Actions.

 -- Roman Contreras <roman.contreras@ciencias.unam.mx>  Sun, 08 Nov 2026 12:00:00 -0600

sb (0.1.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Remove the pre-release history migration helper and the installer's
    --libdir option.
  * Document --check, --version, --config-file and -v in the man pages and
    --help output.

 -- Roman Contreras <roman.contreras@ciencias.unam.mx>  Sat, 07 Nov 2026 22:00:00 -0600

sb (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release.

